<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Stew is a form of a very nourishing meal, cooked in bulk over fire. This research also gives access to the wood-fired pot necessary to cook stews.-->
  <VCE_StewCooking.description>炖菜是一种非常营养的膳食，在火上批量烹制。这项研究还提供了烹饪炖菜所需的燃木锅。</VCE_StewCooking.description>
  <VCE_StewCooking.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->hearth and heart-->
    <li>subject-&gt;炉心与心</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->embraced the tradition of stew cooking, bringing together community and cuisine over the warmth of a shared pot-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;拥抱炖菜烹饪的传统，在共用锅的温暖下将社区和美食融为一体</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->cultivated techniques to craft stews that are not only nourishing but carry the flavors of cultural heritage and togetherness-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心制作的炖菜不仅营养丰富，而且带有文化遗产和团结的味道</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced the wood-fired pot, an essential tool for preparing these hearty meals in the traditional way-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;介绍了燃木锅，这是以传统方式准备丰盛饭菜的必备工具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->nurturing bodies and souls with the communal art of stew making-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用公共炖菜艺术滋养身体和灵魂</li>
  </VCE_StewCooking.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: stew cooking-->
  <VCE_StewCooking.label>炖煮</VCE_StewCooking.label>
</LanguageData>
